// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P1770580793" "Please...please don't do this..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3236353501" "What do you want of me?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3365892486" "Please...just don't hurt me..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3767405348" "I-I don't know what you want..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P782074671" "I'll tell you whatever you want.  Just...just please don't hurt me."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P651184932" "What are you doing??"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P4076207373" "Don't...move."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3156122679" "Shhh...  Don't be afraid.  The transformation will surprise you."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3318557992" "Quiet.  You should be honored to be chosen."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3435925386" "Hush.  This is an honor.  You should be thanking me."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P1937910524" "Silence, human."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3170263204" "You tarnish the honor.  Silence!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P615013694" "NO!  Not now!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1936002652" "No interruptions!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2989521140" "Take care of it!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2775057379" "No!  Not again!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_SNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3183638931" "Ah!  Noooo!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P706606850" "Soon.  Very...soon."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2648722765" "I await the change with excitement."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4085109821" "So many possibilities."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1165168155" "We are special..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2718042564" "Now is our time.  I am sure of it."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P966384905" "They have no idea what we are destined for.  No idea..."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3404435140" "You!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3971831740" "Now is the time for reckoning."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2589278761" "Prepare for some pain!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P2682757791" "Just let me go.  I don't want any of this."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P1759694515" "What are you doing?  Are you crazy?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P1332905564" "What is all this?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P685153948" "You guys are insane!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P2454561158" "What is wrong with you?  You can't keep me here."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P1759731124" "Our time is coming, we need more soldiers.  You will do nicely."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P2700776836" "You should be grateful.  This is a gift.  You are so unworthy."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P912014412" "Quiet.  Or I will make you be quiet and it will not be pleasant."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P2270512500" "Stop talking.  You anger me with your ungratefulness."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P2100970005" "Well, if I don't use this one for the transformation, I suppose we could just kill him."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DOORAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3977209924" "This one!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DOORAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4146730625" "Get this one!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DOORAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3768250182" "Attack!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DOORAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P558206196" "Get 'em!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DOORAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P961605743" "You'll do."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1772188248" "How much longer, do you think?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P531985023" "I'm so excited.  I really feel like the time is near now."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P695761763" "These people, they have no idea what's coming, do they?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P629271435" "Soon, everything will be different.  I can feel it in my bones."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P130994299" "Already, the changes.  The flood.  So soon now."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2994600466" "My body aches with this transformation.  The heat helps."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3019564000" "You know what to do!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P212136796" "Take that one down!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3498166118" "No!  This stops here!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4136939109" "You are not fit to breathe our air!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3336265191" "Your time is over!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1512300217" "Take that one, too!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4229305447" "Leave him.  Get that one!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2992315000" "I have plans for this one!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1801133870" "You will not thwart my plans!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3061995923" "No!  Interruptions are unacceptable!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3245553055" "Times are changing.  No longer will we sit back and preach.  Now...we start preparations."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1300563778" "Remember:  everyone who is not with us, is against us and all that is to come."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3417729380" "The changes...the flood...it's all part of it.  They have no idea.  None at all."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2879833199" "Let the brothers peddle the prophecy in Skyway City.  We are done with that here.  Here, we prepare."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2659722820" "Destiny is upon us.  Silly heroes, they have no idea."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3369036471" "The Vahzilok are burying bodies in the construction yards.  We need to get to those victims first.  We can use them alive."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2480807264" "Use the construction workers.  They're fit.  They'll make good test subjects."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P218414646" "YOU are not part of the grand plan, hero."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P47605636" "Heroes.  I hate heroes."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2112094112" "I'm going to rough you up, hero."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1626229980" "When I'm through with you, they're going to need dental records for identification."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1118247230" "You, hero, are INSIGNIFICANT!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4117329715" "That one won't survive."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1777259258" "That one's not worth a transformation."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1082825724" "Didn't we abduct that one last week?  Oh right.  Not up to par."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4168999659" "We should visit the construction sites later.  Perfect place for victims."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3187366367" "Construction site?  Sure.  But not after dark, Vahzilok's been spotted there during that time."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3807963381" "It's bone-breaking time!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1367539617" "I don't like you, hero."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2432035495" "I'm going to squash you like a bug, hero!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1643209097" "You're going to be a spot on the sole of my shoe."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTCLOCKWORK_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4187917113" "This is where it ends, Clockwork."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTCLOCKWORK_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1338923724" "You are nothing but cogs and parts.  No match for The Lost!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTCLOCKWORK_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4267730639" "You're due for the junkyard soon, Clockwork!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTCLOCKWORK_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1687563344" "It's scrapyard time for you now, Clockwork!"

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTFREAKSHOW_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4207141723" "You are a blight, Freakshow!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTFREAKSHOW_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P742366814" "You really are freaks!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTFREAKSHOW_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1709323586" "There is no room in the future for you, Freak!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTFREAKSHOW_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2018160729" "You are part of the past, not part of the future!  You are nothing!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTFREAKSHOW_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3564364721" "I hate you freaks!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1253675974" "I see many threats to our compound.  Many of them.  Keep alert."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1337130481" "Well, if either Arachnos or Freakshow try to move in on our territory, we'll give them the fight of their life."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2224093217" "Arachnos, mostly.  On the other side of the water, the Freakshow have made their own base of operations.  Some Freedom Corps, too, but not enough to worry about."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_BINOCULARS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3886468518" "You can't come in here!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_BINOCULARS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1940136809" "Stay out!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_BINOCULARS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3595875657" "You can't be in here!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3128123418" "What are you doing here?!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1227173173" "You can't be here!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1441165038" "You're not part of the plan!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4173592142" "Get out!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_KNEELER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P891864769" "The pain is part of it.  He'll be fine."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_KNEELER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3712801664" "It's a growth process.  Of course it hurts."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_KNEELER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1046175173" "You went through it.  I went through it.  He has to go through it.  He'll be fine."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_KNEELER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P901816747" "The transformation separates the wheat from the chaff.  This is where he proves himself.  Let him be."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P61340507" "It is as you say."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2401395703" "He will be stronger for it."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2201489430" "That is exactly what I was thinking."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P26530454" "We'll keep an eye on him for a few days.  Just let him rest."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2923919289" "We survived it.  He will, too.  If not, it wasn't meant to be."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2006202925" "You cannot be in here!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2557609430" "How did you get in here?!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_TRANSFORM_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1809808006" "Your eyes are undeserving!  You may not be here!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P718942213" "You picked the wrong place for a stroll."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1975138195" "Wrong turn, pal."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3139849481" "I'm going to break you in three."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P465164100" "How many cops do you think are in there?  One good spray of gunfire and we take out half the force in this city."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1056618942" "It's a donut shop.  We can take out half the force in this city with one good blast."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3201831992" "I say we go for it.  The police have been interfering almost as much as those heroes.  We need to take them out."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3042204414" "You heard too much!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4282126909" "Can't let you live after hearing what you heard."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2701142446" "I don't care if you didn't hear a thing.  You're a liability now."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3668557094" "Take 'em out!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P438673119" "No witnesses!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOST_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1804650967" "Quiet.  I'm working.  You see?  THIS is how we bring in the future.  Massive destruction."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOST_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P910051392" "This place is going to up like fireworks on festival day.  Now shush.  This is tricky work and if you haven't noticed, my hands aren't exactly cooperataive."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOST_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1372183428" "Look, do you want me to blow us all up?  I'm not exactly at 100% here and this is icky picky work.  So just keep a look out and shoot whatever walks by."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOST_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4149651741" "It won't be long now.  Just a few more seconds..."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOST_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2154845147" "Finish up!  We've got snoopers."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOST_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1286577711" "Sigh.  Here we go.  Attack the intruders."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOST_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3778484432" "Why can't you just leave us alone?!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARDENTRANCE_DEFENDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4278525525" "Nobody gets in here.  Shoot anyone who gets within 20 feet."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARDENTRANCE_DEFENDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2411875833" "You know what to do if anyone gets too close.  Don't be afraid to inflict maximum carnage."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARDENTRANCE_DEFENDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P489260871" "You have your orders.  No one, I mean no one, gets in here."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARDENTRANCE_DEFENDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P389309274" "This place is our sanctuary, let no one invade it."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARDENTRANCE_DEFENDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P924711794" "You are not allowed in here!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARDENTRANCE_DEFENDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2209960613" "This place is not for you!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARDENTRANCE_DEFENDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1383942110" "Get the hero!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_SLEEPING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2275972222" "You interrupted my rest."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_SLEEPING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P782927869" "Well that was rude."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_SLEEPING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P779444816" "I was resting, you know!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DESTRUCTIBLEMAIL_ATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2357434115" "TODO: Add Text"


// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2114639909" "Well?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2829572310" "What do you see?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2966199584" "Hurry it up."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3933267666" "Not you again!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3725838216" "You never get the hint, hero!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3914601571" "I'm not going in there.  No way."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2520553145" "I don't swim."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P534348889" "I'm not going in there."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3404860222" "Bet that one swims!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P377464204" "Dunk 'em!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3980847221" "Let's dunk the hero!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P4156002574" "What?  What is going on here?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P809573457" "Let me go!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P2812934441" "Are you kidding me with this?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P1835717144" "Quiet!  I'm giving you a gift!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3844991329" "You don't even deserve what I offer!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P1210714272" "Quiet!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P2709899567" "Be silent.  I'm tired of listening to this."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3955808072" "Leave us alone, hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4062016766" "You're interfering, hero!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2206913802" "Get out of here! This is none of your business!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DOORAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P701006887" "That was close! <em>Whoa!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DOORAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P37428701" "I have you now!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DOORAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4275792057" "Surprise!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1598254771" "Nothing to see here."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2020791847" "I'm not sure what I'm looking for here."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1637055469" "What was that?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P392889894" "Did you see something?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1361513541" "Why do they think they need to 'cure' us?  We're not infected."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1933803763" "I see something!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3961987023" "Hero, incoming!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3178375819" "Here we go!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2704085297" "I feel sick."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3168332553" "I'm exhausted.  Is this part of the transformation?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3554006280" "Do you think they have any idea what we will become?  How great we will be?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1331111898" "The transformation is a cleansing.  Pain is part of it, that's ok."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3557356577" "That one.  Seriously.  Lost.  They just don't know it yet."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1909214994" "How long are we going to sit here?  My end parts are falling asleep."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2208575211" "How about that one?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P504118527" "It's amusing watching all of the petty politics of this place."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3038429147" "I'm tired."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P575662513" "Let's break into a building.  See what we can find."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3537076566" "You interrupted my discussion."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P723975276" "I was talking, you know!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3946624954" "Hero alert!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2776633569" "Let's end it, hero!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1872926364" "I suppose so."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1084111377" "Well, yes, I see your point on that issue, but it doesn't change anything.  Destiny is destiny."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2588204327" "Sometimes being a catalyst of change, you need to crack a few skulls."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1186424090" "I said catalyst of change, not cataclysm. <em> Wait, that works, too."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1529040615" "I just don't get that 'stealing candy from a baby' thing.  It'd be all gummy and gross.  Who would want that anyway? <em>Fine.  Besides you."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1186336123" "One day, I would like to go to the War Zone, too.   One day."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4156718834" "If you could do it all over again...would you?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P94610077" "It's the oddest thing.  I can't get warm."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P190367374" "WHAT?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1035074658" "It says here that the War Zone is a real hot spot of activity."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P475519418" "Ha!  Fred got picked up in Faultline on a moving violations charge!  That's funny!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1943327541" "What?  My stock went down?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3371244801" "Hey, Joe, you're in here!  That job you did in Kings Row last week?  Page 3!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1135476069" "Well, I'll be..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1965411988" "Well, that's disturbing."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2196743234" "Hm..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P157988327" "You can have the comics section when I'm done.  I'm not done."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3734720050" "More Zig prisoners broke out.  Big surprise there."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P555230469" "She married HIM?  Man, I didn't see that one coming."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2835588740" "Huh.  You know that new movie you want to see?  Yeah, it's not doing too good at the box office."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2481205334" "Yikes.  Bad review on that book I wanted to read. <em>Bah, I'll read it anyway."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_READPAPEROUTLOUD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1042872083" "Half price at what store now?  <em>Heh heh.  Free price for us anyway."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P753776019" "No way."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2911776787" "Yeah?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3623051902" "Say anything about me?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3558948009" "Let me see the comics when you're done."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P491517075" "What?  What does it say?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1632684923" "Tell me more."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P279354552" "Well, I'll be."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3274561368" "Rude!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1551308675" "I was waiting for my turn!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2204923108" "Hey!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NEWSPAPERUPDATE_TALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2306355953" "Great!  Now I won't get the comics secion!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1919912094" "Oh, I see lots of good stuff in there."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2840954371" "I can't see anything."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P584463787" "I can't get a good enough view."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4070184700" "What am I looking for again?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1142486428" "I can't see a thing.  Why don't we just  go inside?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2983508946" "So we're destined for greatness.  Why again am I peering in this window like some two-bit hoodlum?  Aren't we better than this?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2693155504" "We weren't doing anything and you can't prove it!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3745097553" "What?!  He lost his keys!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1952667814" "Don't look at me like that!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P564941591" "Night's best.  Always.  Less distractions.  Darkness."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2138737413" "So...are we good?  Everyone know the plan?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3884637542" "No, dimwit, kill the lights, then charge in.  Element of surprise.  Get it?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P40462160" "I don't understand how you don't understand.  Do you need me to draw you a map?  It's a lock.  Smash it."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P111348722" "What?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P32007594" "I heard something!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4041314465" "Wait for it...THERE!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P116457420" "What was that? <em>There!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTTROLLS_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3014330251" "Useless!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTTROLLS_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1492053689" "You're so hopped up on Superadine that you don't know what you're saying!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTTROLLS_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2340430490" "You guys are as a dumb as a box of hair!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_LOSTTROLLS_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1779452842" "Are you kidding me with this?  That's all you got??"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_OUTCASTSLOST_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P833158872" "Oh yeah?   Who says?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_OUTCASTSLOST_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P871666487" "You got nothing!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_OUTCASTSLOST_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2394195321" "We're gonna own you!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_OUTCASTSLOST_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3763670833" "Outcasts are so last week!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_OUTCASTSLOST_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4106511244" "Your destiny is nothing, pal, not beyond Stteel Canyon!  Let's talk about OUR domain, huh?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SLEEPING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P248590576" "Huh?  Wha?  I'm up!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SLEEPING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1074317097" "You woke me up!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SLEEPING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2872810160" "I was in the middle of a good dream.  Now I'm mad!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P731136484" "You're dead."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P643299925" "Gotcha."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3873055010" "I'm on to you!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P615266023" "Whatcha doing?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P739955435" "Man, that costume is ugly."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1319231816" "That's an awful costume."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3731665524" "That costume doesn't make you look AT ALL heroic."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2511373723" "It's going to be a long night."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P692216226" "I'm hungry."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P372754987" "Where's Jimmy?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P691839920" "Who did that?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3216504439" "Oh my gosh, that's bad, was that you, Frank?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3453931496" "What?!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P429546228" "You're out of your league!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4162178576" "What?  You want a written invitation?  Let's fight, pal!"

